{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"没在想\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"text\": \"难堪没让他少喜欢，可再多给一点，也证明不了自己什么都不求。\",\n      \"key\": \"再多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他仍盼被珍惜，也把心思放回眼前愿意做的关心，不再反复查验对方心意。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿意做的关心\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"text\": \"关心对方时，他觉得喜欢本身就很甜，暂时忘了自己为什么那么在意回应，可那念头过一会儿又会回来。\",\n      \"key\": \"喜欢本身就很甜\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"text\": \"独自静下来，亲近时的开心没能让他忘掉那个疑问，心里发酸，也怕这点快乐留不住。\",\n      \"key\": \"快乐留不住\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S05-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S06-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R24\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-1\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"沿用上一轮修补，保留难堪没有削弱喜欢、继续给予也无法证明自己毫无期待的意思，把抽象的矛盾改成具体的自我证明失败。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R25\", \"R26\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-2\"],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"沿用上一轮修补，合并不反复查验与把心思放回眼前关心，保留他仍盼被珍惜、又真心愿意关心对方的两面。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R26\", \"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-3\"],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"沿用上一轮修补，保留关心时尝到的真实甜意，以及回应念头暂退又回来的变化，避免把甜意写成脱离个人经历的格言。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\"R27\"],\n      \"now\": [\"S06-4\"],\n      \"what\": \"补足原因\",\n      \"why\": \"保留甜意真实、心意仍无着落的两面，补出独自静下来时，亲近带来的开心不再能让他忘掉那个疑问，因此心里发酸，也担心快乐留不住。其余条目沿用上一轮修补。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "44ac2ba1-935b-4b93-b460-62753799dd9c", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T184126372271Z", "elapsed_seconds": 579.75, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T18:51:06.135013+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "1a562208edefd4068b136eb3f2157831ac8a02ed5b9a2a79ac6bd54dd9dfb8b6", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T184126372271Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3f145e7b06fa2db601e03a36cac71a1eb41e7cd1ae4e0c9e3d75f5f6f4060eba"}}}
